---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import config from "../../data/config.json";
import faqs from "../../data/faqs.json";
const meta = {"url": "/corporate-glass-awards/", "title": "Engraved Glass & Crystal Awards Cardiff | Grimes Engravers", "description": "Engraved glass and crystal awards for staff awards nights, long service and events across Cardiff and South Wales. Orders from 10 items."};
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description} path={meta.url} faqs={faqs["corporate-glass-awards"]} scripts={[]}>
<section style="background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem">
<div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 3rem">
<div style="flex: 1 1 26rem; min-width: 0">
<p style="display: inline-block; margin: 0 0 1rem; background: #FFFFFF; color: #23263A; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 999px">Minimum order 10 items</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: #F3A3A6; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase">Glass &amp; crystal awards</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.12">Engraved glass &amp; crystal awards</h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #D1D5DB">Engraved glass and crystal awards for staff awards nights, long service and events, with a minimum order of 10 items. Email us your catalogue codes and we’ll quote within 24 hours.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem">
<a href="/contact/" style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #23263A; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 6px">Tell us what you need</a>
<a href="mailto:info@grimesengravers.com" style="border: 2px solid #9CA3AF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Email us</a></div></div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 22rem; min-width: 0"><img src="/assets/img/glass-award.jpg" alt="Engraved glass award" style="width: 100%; height: 20rem; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; display: block"></div>
</div></section>
<section aria-label="Minimum order" style="background: #FFF8E6; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1E2B8; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem">
<p style="margin: 0; color: #1F2933; font-size: 1.15rem"><strong>Minimum order: 10 glass awards.</strong> We can’t take orders for fewer than 10 items.</p>
<a href="/contact/" style="background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 6px">Get a quote for 10+</a></div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Glass awards companies order from us</h2><p style="margin: 0 0 2rem; color: #4B5563; max-width: 44rem">Repeat work for some of Cardiff’s largest employers, year after year.</p><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Glass &amp; crystal awards</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Staff awards, sales awards and recognition pieces, engraved with your logo.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Long service awards</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Engraved glass awards for 10, 20 and 25 years’ service.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Sponsors &amp; VIPs</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Glass pieces to thank sponsors, partners and volunteers.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Event &amp; sponsorship awards</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Glass awards for sponsored events, tournaments and charity days.</p></div><div style="background: #F5F6F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Not in the catalogue?</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Send us the idea for a bespoke glass piece and we’ll tell you what’s possible.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background: #F5F6F7; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 3rem">
<div style="flex: 1 1 22rem; min-width: 0"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Catalogue &amp; pricing</h2><p style="margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #4B5563">Browse our glass and crystal catalogue and note the product codes you like. The prices shown are per award. Engraving is added on top, and we confirm the full price in your quote. We are not VAT registered, so there’s no VAT to add.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 1rem"><a href={config.catalogues.glass} target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display: inline-block; background: #3D5A5E; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.8rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Open the glass catalogue ↗</a></p></div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 22rem; min-width: 0"><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Minimum 10</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Glass award orders start at 10 items.</p></div><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Plus engraving</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Catalogue prices are for the award only. No VAT, as we’re not VAT registered.</p></div><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">Quote in 24 hours</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">On working days, Monday to Friday.</p></div><div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem"><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #1F2933">10–14 working days</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">From your approval of our proof.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">How an order works</h2><ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem"><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">1</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Send your brief</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Catalogue codes, quantity (10+), wording, logo and date. Logos as PDF, EPS or SVG work best.</p></div></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">2</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Quote in 24 hours</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">One price for the whole order, including engraving. No VAT to add.</p></div></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">3</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Approve your proof</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">We email a proof of the engraving for you to sign off.</p></div></li><li style="display: flex; gap: 1rem"><span style="flex: none; width: 2.6rem; height: 2.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #23263A; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">4</span><div><h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #1F2933">Delivered together</h3><p style="margin: 0; color: #4B5563">Ready 10–14 working days after you approve the proof.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section style="background: #FFFFFF; padding: 4rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto"><div style="max-width: 48rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem)">Frequently asked questions</h2><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0" open=""><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Is there a minimum order?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Glass award orders start at 10 items. For memorial and bench plaques there’s no minimum.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Are the catalogue prices final?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Catalogue prices are per item, and engraving is added on top. We confirm the full price in your quote. We are not VAT registered, so no VAT is added.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Can you use our company logo?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Yes. Send it as a PDF, EPS or SVG and we’ll set it up for engraving.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">How far ahead should we order?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">We quote within 24 hours (working days), and awards are ready 10–14 working days after you approve our proof. Allow at least 3–4 weeks before your event.</p></details><details style="border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding: 1rem 0"><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; color: #1F2933">Can we reorder the same item next year?</summary><p style="margin: 0.6rem 0 0; color: #4B5563">Yes. We keep your artwork and specification on file, so repeat orders match exactly.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section style="background: #3D5A5E; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem">
<div style="flex: 1 1 24rem"><h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600">Planning an awards night?</h2><p style="margin: 0; color: #E5ECEC">Email your catalogue codes, quantity and date and we’ll quote within 24 hours.</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem"><a href="/contact/" style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #3D5A5E; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 6px">Request a quote</a>
<a href="mailto:info@grimesengravers.com" style="border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; padding: 0.75rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 6px">Email us</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
